## Reliability corrections

Owner decision after the initial build: adopt the supplied numerical formula as
active planning/drafting targets, retaining the source numbers and caveats. The
compiler now embeds its craft sections verbatim. These limitations qualify the
research claims; they do not authorize removing the owner's chosen targets.

| Observation | Limitation | Operational use |
|---|---|---|
| Sentence mean 14.63, short-sentence share 27.7% | Whisper supplies punctuation; results depend on segmentation and recognition quality | Apply the formula's rounded 14.6 target and 27.7% share; document measurement method |
| Paragraph median 18 and mean 26.8 words | Inferred from narrated pauses, not print paragraph boundaries | Distinguish written thought groups from performed silence |
| 282 scene proxies, 950.3 mean words per scene | 325,955 / 282 is about 1,156; an undocumented subset could explain the mismatch | Preserve ~950 as the selected directional target; report inconsistency rather than silently correcting it |
| 900 / 471 / 514 progression terms by third | Regex terms are not progression events; early vs mean of later thirds is about 1.83, not 1.7 | Teach needed rules early and revisit them at meaningful changes |
| Character development and POV percentages | Name/reflection heuristics and alias splits (for example Aria/Arya) do not establish POV or completed development beats | Use actual scenes, choices and knowledge boundaries in review |
| Reading grade 6.8 | Depends on transcript punctuation and syllable estimation | Test comprehension in context instead of treating grade as proof |
| Fixed cast-function analogies | They import another book's character architecture into every new story | Build this book's cast from independent wants and relationships |

The original legal assertions in the craft formula are not validated by this build
and are not carried into the author's operating instructions. The new profile uses
broad craft attributes in original work. Numerical targets ARE included in compiled
planning and author prompts at the owner's request. Novel quotations, character
substitutions and source scene sequences are excluded.

## What survives

Legible tactical exchanges; learning demonstrated under pressure; developed major
fights; specific wonder at first power use; friendships with independent agency;
humor that coexists with consequence; varied sentences; clear punctuation; growth
that changes the next decision. The owner's accepted language takes priority.

The author profile has no mandatory Kindling setting, device, academy, ceremony,
epigraph, or series length. Those belong to the chosen project's map. A successful
compiler test establishes usable plumbing; prose quality still requires a real
movement and an honest reader review.

